{'symbol': 'PODD', 'date': '2019-11-04 22:30:00', 'title': 'INSULET CORPORATION REVISES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE QUARTER AND PROVIDES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019', 'text': 'INSULET CORPORATION REVISED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE QUARTER AND PROVIDED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019. FOR THE YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019, THE COMPANY IS RAISING ITS REVENUE GUIDANCE TO A RANGE OF $722 TO $730 MILLION, REPRESENTING GROWTH OF 28% TO 29% (PREVIOUSLY 24% TO 27%).FOR THE QUARTER ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019, THE COMPANY EXPECTS REVENUE IN THE RANGE OF $193 TO $201 MILLION, REPRESENTING GROWTH OF 17% TO 22%.'}